Template: kvm-host-iso/encrypt
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Encrypt the disks?
 Encrypts the system disk and the disk for VM images. The passphrase
 must be entered at the console on every boot.

Template: partman-auto/select_disk
Type: select
Choices-C: ${CHOICES}
Choices: ${DESCRIPTIONS}
Description: System disk for Debian:
 Select the system disk: Debian, the operating system of the KVM host,
 will be installed on it, and all data on it will be erased.
 .
 The disk for virtual machine files is selected separately on the
 first boot.
